        "slc_8c40802ecd5543e5e4a49a7ac18d67936b20b43d5d507dd649c74710a69c192d"
      ],
      "text": "GrapeRoot is described as an open-source launcher that sits between the user and an AI coding assistant, building a semantic graph of files, symbols, imports, and call chains to pre-load relevant code into each prompt."
    },
