      "text": "The product exposes launcher commands: `dgc` for Claude Code, `dg` for Codex CLI, `dgo` for OpenCode, and `graperoot . --<tool>` flags for Cursor, Gemini CLI, Copilot, OpenClaw, Kilocode, MiMo Code, Antigravity, Kiro CLI, and Command Code."
